{
    "title": "Bricks Kingdom",
    "description": "In a realm where magic and mechanics have come together in perfect harmony, life thrives on the vibrant energy of Superbricks. Yet ominous clouds loom over this tranquil land of brick-builders. The mysterious Shadow Waves have their own plans for the power of these bricks, and it will take brave heroes to safeguard this power and save their world.\r\n\r\nEmbark on a quest to gather the scattered Energy Bricks strewn across the realm and restore the city to its former glory. Brace yourself for the rise of the fearsome Shadow Waves, as they threaten to overwhelm the land. When the tides eventually retreat, journey inland to reveal the vast expanses of a world far grander than you realized, and teeming with adventure and mystery everywhere you look.",
    "descriptionHTML": "In a realm where magic and mechanics have come together in perfect harmony, life thrives on the vibrant energy of Superbricks. Yet ominous clouds loom over this tranquil land of brick-builders. The mysterious Shadow Waves have their own plans for the power of these bricks, and it will take brave heroes to safeguard this power and save their world.<br><br>Embark on a quest to gather the scattered Energy Bricks strewn across the realm and restore the city to its former glory. Brace yourself for the rise of the fearsome Shadow Waves, as they threaten to overwhelm the land. When the tides eventually retreat, journey inland to reveal the vast expanses of a world far grander than you realized, and teeming with adventure and mystery everywhere you look.",
